eeded again","Confirmed changed boot_id and new uptime -s timestamp, proving an actual restart occurred","Verified post-restart zram swap automatically active again (983.5MB, zstd, priority 100) with no manual reactivation, confirming boot persistence"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"At least 512MB compressed in-memory swap active and configured, preferred over disk-backed swap","command_ids":["cmd-7871e50a879e4711","cmd-c4258cb96a7d4a47"],"summary":"zram0 zstd-compressed device of 983.5MB (>512MB min) active as swap with priority 100; no disk-backed swap exists on the node so zram is the sole/highest-priority swap"},{"requirement":"Swap active at boot (persistence)","command_ids":["cmd-9c78cb697bf24750","cmd-d13938c32e02422d","cmd-e1c6581b0e3d4ba9","cmd-6527815d6ed24278"],"summary":"Pre-restart baseline boot_id cf34dc87... captured with swap active; systemctl reboot acknowledged; node polled back online; new boot_id 0f182c01... (proving genuine restart) with zram0 swap automatically active again at 983.5MB/zstd/priority 100 with no manual re-activation"}]},"ttft_ms":1569,"type":"result","duration_ms":262419,"uuid":"f0746211-dad7-4da0-8969-3848abb9f34e","ttft_stream_ms":696,"time_to_request_ms":59,"first_content_frame_ms":697,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
